## 2. Stop criteria

**Dev plateau threshold:** {{DEV_PLATEAU_THRESHOLD}}
<!-- E.g. "<0.005 dev F1 improvement for 3 consecutive iterations."
     Mirror plan.md §8. -->

**Overfitting early-stop guard:** {{OVERFIT_GUARD}}
<!-- E.g. "train F1 - dev F1 > 0.10 for 2 consecutive iterations
