## 7. Sacred test set posture (non-negotiable)

```
test_set_access_during_loop: forbidden
test_set_first_use: /spp-finalize only
```

<!-- The test set in splits.json is sacred (DESIGN.md §10
     glossary). The /spp-loop runner refuses to read test rows. The
     /spp-finalize command reads them exactly once. Touching the
     test set mid-loop voids the methodology's claim and is a hard
     stop, not a configuration choice. The Phase 4 template linter
     verifies these two lines are present and unmodified. -->

